## Original Content
Производство первичного алюминия в странах Персидского залива в июле составило 293 тыс. тонн, что на 44% меньше объема за тот же месяц 2025 года, согласно предварительным расчетам Международного института алюминия (IAI).

## Summary
Primary aluminum production in the Gulf countries fell by 44% year-on-year in July, reaching 293 thousand tons. This decline was reported in preliminary calculations by the International Aluminum Institute.

## Key Points
- Aluminum production in the Gulf countries dropped by 44% compared to July 2025.
- The production volume was 293 thousand tons in July.
- The data is based on preliminary estimates from the International Aluminum Institute.
- This indicates a significant year-on-year decrease in aluminum output.


